==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Bouffalant|118}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Continuous Headbutt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Linoone|38}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

